# n2p2 standard Kalman filter on the pyamff energy-only squared error.
# One force call is one loss-gradient evaluation. The filter updates once per structure.
# Structures are permuted each epoch with PCG64, after the uniform[-1, 1) weights are drawn.
# loss commit 8037eb98e2288c132c112aa6c2032f00cd5c5277. gradient tolerance 0.02. force RMSE is -1.0 because forces are not trained.
n 50
nfailed 0
cap 10000
counter harness
code n2p2
code_version 2.3.0
commit 29b9c9f10b1ac9ea45631b3d556a129ca3b701c2
algorithm Kalman
template n2p2/emt-pt38-kalman
problem mlopt/emt-pt38
tuning default
mean_force_rmse -1.0
median_force_rmse -1.0
force_calls 32
mean_epoch 31.50000000
median_epoch 22.50000000
mean_energy_rmse 0.000718322575654677
median_energy_rmse 0.0005605418595992062
par2_mean 31.5
median 22.5
median_low 17.5
median_high 38.5
wilson_low 0.9286524008666414
wilson_high 1.0
n_cap 0
n_divergence 0
n_crash 0
n_wrong_stationary 0
